        "explanation": "<h3>Decimals are like Money</h3><p>Think of $1.50.</p><ul><li>The '1' is a whole dollar.</li><li>The '.50' is part of a dollar (50 cents).</li></ul><p>The dot (.) just separates the big wholes from the small parts!</p><div class='interactive-block'><h4>Try It!</h4><p>If you have $2.50, how many whole dollars?</p><input type='text' class='form-control' placeholder='Enter number'><button class='btn btn-sm btn-primary try-it-btn' data-answer='2'>Check</button><div class='feedback'></div></div>",
